# Kernel and cfg80211 symbols the out-of-tree 8189fs imports, kept exported
# under CONFIG_TRIM_UNUSED_KSYMS (which un-exports everything no in-tree
# module uses). From `mipsel-linux-gnu-nm -u 8189fs.ko` of the driver built
# with its debug code on (CONFIG_RTW_DEBUG, CONFIG_PROC_DEBUG, CONFIG_BR_EXT),
# a superset of what build.sh's build needs, so the debug build loads on the
# same kernel. A symbol missing here fails build.sh (modpost), not the camera.
__ashldi3
__bswapsi2
__cfg80211_alloc_event_skb
__cfg80211_alloc_reply_skb
__cfg80211_get_bss
__cfg80211_send_event_skb
__init_swait_queue_head
